description:
The Council commissioned a number of supported accommodation services to meet the needs that have been identified for these types of provision, divided into the following Lots;

Lot 1:	Emergency Accommodation 16-21 Years of Age

Lot 2:	Young People&#039;s Supported Housing for;
	16 - 21 Year Olds with Complex Needs &amp; 
	16 - 17 Year Olds with Medium Needs

Lot 3:	Young Peoples Supported Housing for 18-21 Year Olds with Medium Needs 

Lot 4: 	Young People&#039;s Dispersed Accommodation with Support for 16-17 Year Olds

Lot 5:	Young People&#039;s Dispersed Accommodation with Support for 18-21 Year Olds

This was a further competition from the Council&#039;s Pseudo DPS for All Age Accommodation and/or Support.

No bids were received for Lot 4 therefore this lot was not awarded.
